<p>Harold Maine, why you gotta be such a <em>dick</em>?</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;spoilers</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
