<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I wasn't as much a fan of the first part - the fact that the murder happened was horrific enough, the description of it and the reveal that she had been raped felt to me like they were just added for shock value - but the quality of the writing, and the ending with Aidan in the shower saved it for me.</p>
<p>Upvoted.</p>
